{"architectures":["x86"],"id":"JurgenRathlev.innounp","latestVersion":"2.70.1","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.c843e72d.png","priority":1,"sha256":"c843e72d387c83b5ed49acc069e4d9a894076669a091676a8cc9738aa025a5c7","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Unpacker for installations made by Inno Setup","license":"MPL or LGPL-2.0-or-later","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/jrathlev/InnoUnpacker-Windows-GUI/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Unpacker for installations made by Inno Setup","license":"MPL or LGPL-2.0-or-later","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/jrathlev/InnoUnpacker-Windows-GUI/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Inno Setup is a popular program for making software installations. Inno Setup Unpacker is a console application to verify and get files out of the self-extracting executable.\nSince there have been no updates of the SourceForge project since 2020 and the source codes are not yet adapted to the current Delphi versions (Unicode strings are the native type since Delphi 2009), I have modified them so that they can be compiled with newer Delphi versions (tested with Delphi 10 Seattle). In addition, some errors have been fixed and new command line options (-l and -u) were added, as well as exit codes to support the use in batch files.","name":"innounp","packageUrl":"https://www.rathlev-home.de/tools/prog-e.html#unpack","publisher":"Jürgen Rathlev","publisherUrl":"https://www.rathlev-home.de/index-e.html","tags":["extract","extractor","inno-setup","innosetup","innounp","unpack","unpacker"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"Unpacker for installations made by Inno Setup","license":"MPL 或 LGPL-2.0-or-later","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/jrathlev/InnoUnpacker-Windows-GUI/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Inno Setup 是一款常用的软件安装程序。Inno Setup Unpacker 是一款控制台应用程序，用于验证并从自解压可执行文件中获取文件。\n由于 SourceForge 项目自 2020 年以来一直没有更新，且源代码尚未适应当前的 Delphi 版本（从 Delphi 2009 开始，Unicode 字符串成为原生类型），因此我对源代码进行了修改，使其可以在较新的 Delphi 版本下编译（使用 Delphi 10 Seattle 进行了测试）。此外，还修正了一些错误，添加了新的命令行选项（-l 和 -u）以及退出代码，以支持在批处理文件中使用。","name":"innounp","packageUrl":"https://www.rathlev-home.de/tools/prog-e.html#unpack","publisher":"Jürgen Rathlev","publisherUrl":"https://www.rathlev-home.de/index-e.html","tags":["inno-setup","innosetup","innounp","提取","提取器","解包","解包器"]}},"longDescription":"Inno Setup is a popular program for making software installations. Inno Setup Unpacker is a console application to verify and get files out of the self-extracting executable.\nSince there have been no updates of the SourceForge project since 2020 and the source codes are not yet adapted to the current Delphi versions (Unicode strings are the native type since Delphi 2009), I have modified them so that they can be compiled with newer Delphi versions (tested with Delphi 10 Seattle). In addition, some errors have been fixed and new command line options (-l and -u) were added, as well as exit codes to support the use in batch files.","name":"innounp","packageUrl":"https://www.rathlev-home.de/tools/prog-e.html#unpack","publisher":"Jürgen Rathlev","publisherUrl":"https://www.rathlev-home.de/index-e.html","tags":["extract","extractor","inno-setup","innosetup","innounp","unpack","unpacker"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x86"],"detailPath":"versions/2.70.1/app.json","detailSha256":"886c41cbd6fd9c46d95860634db164ce513a2008bf91014986cbf085c94e3f61","version":"2.70.1"},{"architectures":["x86"],"detailPath":"versions/2.67.11/app.json","detailSha256":"afcb7cedb23968e9cbe707ff047d61c1953cb9609f32de1b80ba0524d59caa70","version":"2.67.11"},{"architectures":["x86"],"detailPath":"versions/2.67.10/app.json","detailSha256":"e870f88a4079a374fbb5b2480205f09ae31304915c7f859f2de7e9d42811ddfb","version":"2.67.10"},{"architectures":["x86"],"detailPath":"versions/2.67.9/app.json","detailSha256":"dd2b335a622879c92a97c051dc742c6713a73ebdc30e7aa6501